n=3, but the MLE is the sum rather than the mean.

Select 24h likes per post, a simple approval proxy for the link change, although low-effort likes need not create value.
Reactions give broad activity but overlap;
comments are discussion but may be spam;
read-more means opening but not external clicking;
shares amplify but are viral.
Balance the sport/review and quality groups.
Calculate per-post click-through by dividing every post count by the page-wide 100,000 daily reach, assuming that is each post's exposure.
Randomize posts, report confidence intervals, and avoid picking an endpoint afterward.

H0 equal means, HA different.
Use Welch for independent roughly normal visits, not known pairs.
